 handling; minisvc/storage/repo.py:OrderRepository.save performs one INSERT.\",contradicted,\"Transient DB failures surface at once and may escape as unhandled errors.\"\n4:\"Audit events are stored in a durable audit table.\",\"README.md design notes\",\"minisvc/audit.py:order_event only returns a dict, and minisvc/storage/repo.py:OrderRepository.init_schema creates only the orders table.\",contradicted,\"There is no durable audit trail for writes or reads.\"\n5:\"The service accepts orders through a small HTTP adapter and a CLI bootstrap command.\",\"README.md intro\",\"pyproject.toml exposes minisvc.cli:main; minisvc/api/routes.py:register_routes binds HTTP routes that call create_order and get_order.\",confirmed,\"Low; this top-level description matches the code.\"\n6:\"An actual HTTP server bootstrap is part of this fixture.\",\"Implied by needing HTTP support, but not stated directly in docs\",\"No app construction or server startup module exists; minisvc/api/routes.py expects an external app object.\",unsupported,\"New engineers may waste time looking for a missing in-repo server entry point.\""}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/out/doc_code_discrepancies.csv","sourcePath":"/workspace/out/doc_code_discrepancies.csv"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788184378997},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_M3K6gBaYslsSUdBEjeSbWpqx|fc_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a95873ad1bc87d2a0ecb0a879372b93","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/risk_register.csv#1273]\n1:risk_id,area,evidence,impact,mitigation,owner_hint\n2:R1,storage/data durability,\"minisvc/storage/repo.py:OrderRepository.init_schema creates only one table and minisvc/storage/repo.py:OrderRepository.save uses a plain sqlite INSERT on a fresh connection each call; minisvc/config.py:load_settings defaults DB path to relative orders.sqlite.\",\"Data can land in an unexpected file and the service has no explicit durability or migration policy beyond the basic SQLite default.\",\"Set an explicit a