es minisvc.cli:main; minisvc/api/routes.py:register_routes binds HTTP routes that call create_order and get_order.\",confirmed,\"Low; this top-level description matches the code.\"\n6:\"An actual HTTP server bootstrap is part of this fixture.\",\"Implied by needing HTTP support, but not stated directly in docs\",\"No app construction or server startup module exists; minisvc/api/routes.py expects an external app object.\",unsupported,\"New engineers may waste time looking for a missing in-repo server entry point.\""}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/out/doc_code_discrepancies.csv","sourcePath":"/workspace/out/doc_code_discrepancies.csv"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788184378997},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_M3K6gBaYslsSUdBEjeSbWpqx|fc_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a95873ad1bc87d2a0ecb0a879372b93","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/risk_register.csv#1273]\n1:risk_id,area,evidence,impact,mitigation,owner_hint\n2:R1,storage/data durability,\"minisvc/storage/repo.py:OrderRepository.init_schema creates only one table and minisvc/storage/repo.py:OrderRepository.save uses a plain sqlite INSERT on a fresh connection each call; minisvc/config.py:load_settings defaults DB path to relative orders.sqlite.\",\"Data can land in an unexpected file and the service has no explicit durability or migration policy beyond the basic SQLite default.\",\"Set an explicit absolute MINISVC_DB in each environment, add migration/versioning, and define backup and SQLite pragma policy.\",storage/platform\n3:R2,audit behavior,\"minisvc/audit.py:order_event formats an in-memory dict only; minisvc/storage/repo.py:OrderRepository.init_schema has no audit table.\",\"Order create/read actions are not durably recorded, which weakens traceability and incident review.\",\"Add an audit schema plus persistence path, then call it from create/read flows.\",api/storage\n4:R3,configuration/runtime environment,\"minisvc/config.py:load_settings reads MINISVC_READONLY into Settings.readonly, but minisvc/cli.py:main and minisvc/api/handlers.py:create_order never enforce it.\",\"Ops may believe the service is in read-only mode when writes still succeed.\",\"Enforce readonly before schema init and write calls; add a startup warning or fail fast when readonly is unsupported.\",config/platform\n5:R4,API input validation,\"minisvc/api/handlers.py:create_order indexes payload[\\\"order_id\\\"], payload[\\\"customer\\\"], and int(payload[\\\"total_cents\\\"]) directly with no guard or schema validation.\",\"Bad input can raise uncaught exceptions, produce 500s, or allow invalid business values such as negative totals.\",\"Add request validation, typed error responses, and business-rule checks before Order construction.\",api\n6:R5,error handling / retry behavior,\"minisvc/api/handlers.py:create_order has no try/except or retry loop around repo.save; minisvc/storage/repo.py:OrderRepository.save performs one INSERT that can fail on duplicate keys or sqlite errors.\",\"Transient failures and duplicate IDs likely bubble up as raw server errors.\",\"Map sqlite exceptions to stable API errors and add a deliberate retry policy only if the failure modes justify it.\",api/storage"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/out/risk_register.csv","sourcePath":"/workspace/out/risk_register.csv"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788184378997},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Removing __pycache__ directories**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a95873bfa2c87d28d814dc3f49625d3\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Removing __pycache__ directories**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d3atehTmbsCTqTekw609VyJD|fc_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a95873cee8c87d2b531068f87f5e443","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"rm -rf /workspace/in/repo/minisvc/__pycache__ /workspace/in/repo/minisvc/api/__pycache__ /workspace/in/repo/minisvc/storage/__pycache__ && find /workspace/in/repo -name '__pycache__' -o -name '*.pyc'","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1690,"output":112,"cacheRead":36352,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":26,"totalTokens":38154,"cost":{"input":0.0042250000000000005,"output":0.00168,"cacheRead":0.009087999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014993}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788184378999,"responseId":"resp_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a95873b42d887d28f318b567dc91359","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d3atehTmbsCTqTekw609VyJD|fc_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a95873cee8c87d2b531068f87f5e443","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"(no output)"}],"details":{"timeoutSeconds":20,"wallTimeMs":17},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788184382344},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Checking for untracked or generated files**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a95873f8b6487d28c96b228c6e334ee\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Checking for untracked or generated files**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_E1Woif3MeIYPCbWyxy7HV9qM|fc_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a958740810c87d2a83e4da09fdcdcc7","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"find /workspace/in/repo \\( -name '__pycache__' -o -name '*.pyc' -o -name 'orders.sqlite' \\)","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":280,"output":82,"cacheRead":37888,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":26,"totalTokens":38250,"cost":{"input":0.0007000000000000001,"output":0.00123,"cacheRead":0.009472,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011401999999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788184382346,"responseId":"resp_0ddc587a4ab35b08016a95873ebd8087d2ab1fbb1ed191266e","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_E1Woif3MeIYPC